anything you cannot stop.

100
00:08:50,251 --> 00:08:52,408
(flat) The panel is accurate.

101
00:08:52,807 --> 00:08:58,487
And that was all he got. He asked eighteen more
times over the following four years, in

102
00:08:58,507 --> 00:09:03,008
four different ways, and the answer never
changed and never expanded.

103
00:09:03,408 --> 00:09:09,873
The ampoule went into the sealed vault on level nine
at Arklay — the one Birkin had never

104
00:09:09,893 --> 00:09:15,558
been able to price, the one the drawings had
always shown and never explained.

105
00:09:15,957 --> 00:09:22,954
It went in on the twenty-second of December 2031. It
came out on the fourth of December

106
00:09:22,974 --> 00:09:23,357
2033.

107
00:09:23,758 --> 00:09:26,618
And the other one, quietly, from the
back of the skull.

108
00:09:27,138 --> 00:09:28,671
You will open it.

109
00:09:29,071 --> 00:09:30,860
Of course I will open it.

110
00:09:31,260 --> 00:09:33,776
You do not know what it does.

111
00:09:34,177 --> 00:09:42,304
I know what it *is*. Everything I am, everything in
that cryogenic hall, everything Evelyn

112
00:09:42,324 --> 00:09:50,452
has built out of a vial some technician labelled *odd*
in 2004 — all of it is a downstream

113
00:09:50,472 --> 00:09:57,967
copy of the thing in that case. I have spent two
lifetimes working from the copies.

114
00:09:58,366 --> 00:10:00,225
And if it kills you?

115
00:10:00,625 --> 00:10:05,555
Then it will have been the only worthy
opponent either of us ever met.

116
00:10:05,955 --> 00:10:08,305
He gave Evelyn Marsh the ice.

117
00:10:08,705 --> 00:10:14,873
Fourteen levels, six hundred and eleven staff who
could not disobey her, four thousand

118
00:10:14,893 --> 00:10:21,134
cryogenic cradles and no oversight of any kind. She
was thirty-two years old. Her title

119
00:10:21,154 --> 00:10:27,682
was Director of the Progenitor Initiative, and the
Initiative had, at that point, precisely

120
00:10:27,702 --> 00:10:34,015
one sealed ampoule that she was not permitted to see
and a mandate of twenty-four words:

121
00:10:34,534 --> 00:10:38,764
Find out what a human being is for,
and then improve it.

122
00:10:39,164 --> 00:10:44,783
She stood on an airstrip in the interior of
Antarctica in a coat with a crimson iris on

123
00:10:44,803 --> 00:10:50,356
the shoulder and looked at a horizon with nothing on
it in any direction, and she said

124
00:10:50,376 --> 00:10:55,930
the thing that the narrator has been waiting fifteen
chapters to report, because it is

125
00:10:55,950 --> 00:10:59,494
the exact moment the story stops
being about a company.

126
00:11:00,014 --> 00:11:01,754
There's no one here to tell me no.

127
00:11:02,154 --> 00:11:02,825
No.

128
00:11:03,225 --> 00:11:07,425
In four years of this I have filled in one
ethics form. One. For a mouse.

129
00:11:07,825 --> 00:11:09,295
Does that trouble you?

130
00:11:09,695 --> 00:11:14,754
And Dr. Evelyn Marsh looked out at
fourteen hundred miles of ice.

131
00:11:15,274 --> 00:11:20,587
It stopped troubling me in about 2029 and I have
been waiting ever since for someone to

132
00:11:20,607 --> 00:11:21,016
notice.

133
00:11:21,417 --> 00:11:27,576
The narrator will note, without comment, that the
Umbrella Antarctic Facility produced

134
00:11:27,596 --> 00:11:33,899
eleven of the fourteen most important papers in
molecular biology published between 2033

135
00:11:33,919 --> 00:11:40,366
and 2041, that every one of them was true, and that
nothing in any of them described where

136
00:11:40,386 --> 00:11:42,307
the material had come from.

137
00:11:43,456 --> 00:11:50,932
Umbrella. Tier three. One hundred and forty-one
thousand personnel, fourteen thousand

138
00:11:50,952 --> 00:11:58,692
two hundred Absolute. Territory: Raccoon City,
population one hundred and four thousand.

139
00:11:58,712 --> 00:12:06,363
Sixty-one facilities. Nine nations with sovereign
contracts. Market capitalisation: one

140
00:12:06,383 --> 00:12:14,300
point one four trillion dollars. Next tier:
Conglomerate. Requirement: absorb an industry.

141
00:12:14,889 --> 00:12:20,269
A trillion dollars. Six years and three months from
