142
00:12:20,668 --> 00:12:26,024
He stood at the window on the last night of 2032 and
looked down at the campus, and at

143
00:12:26,044 --> 00:12:31,462
the river, and at the city beyond it, and the
narrator would like to record what he was

144
00:12:31,482 --> 00:12:36,400
