money and it was not about the ice.

145
00:12:36,921 --> 00:12:38,551
*Absorb an industry.*

146
00:12:38,951 --> 00:12:39,983
Which one?

147
00:12:40,383 --> 00:12:43,033
That is what a smaller man would ask.

148
00:12:43,432 --> 00:12:46,132
Then ask a better question.

149
00:12:46,532 --> 00:12:47,902
How many are there?

150
00:12:48,302 --> 00:12:54,289
Below him, on the plaza, the night shift changed.
Somewhere under his feet, ninety feet

151
00:12:54,309 --> 00:13:00,643
down, two Tyrants breathed once a minute in the dark.
Six miles up a valley in Pennsylvania,

152
00:13:00,663 --> 00:13:06,512
